OL,3,GNEWSACalls for more young people to
OL,4,Atake up HPV vaccine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cancer group says it wants more young
OL,7,Fpeople in Sussex and Surrey to get
OL,8,Ftheir HPV vaccination as part of a bid
OL,9,Fto eliminate certain forms of the
OL,10,Fdisease.
OL,12,FHPV (Human papillomavirus) can cause
OL,13,Fseveral types of cancer, including
OL,14,Fcervical cancer. The NHS says it wants
OL,15,Fto eradicate HPV by 2040.
OL,17,FSurrey and Sussex Cancer Alliance says
OL,18,Ftwo thirds of eligible children across
OL,19,Fboth counties have been vaccinated
OL,20,Fagainst the infection, although levels
OL,21,Fhave not reached those seen before the
OL,22,FCovid-19 pandemic.
